    {
      "post_id": "83706",
      "author_handle": "jo-jo",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 16 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "We didnt bring our children up vegeterian/vegan,but i have found some great vegeterian recipies on the internet. We try to alternate one week with meat in our diet and one week without so far it has worked for us and there have been times where we have gone without meat in our diet for a month and the children have not even noticed.\nI like the thai tofu stirfry.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9172/#83706",
