    {
      "post_id": "84307",
      "author_handle": "kristag",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 16 years 1 month ago",
      "body": "Just be careful that your little one gets all the right nutrients and vitamins. You don't want to have to try and give them supplements as well.  A friend of a friend was vegan and tried to raise her baby on such a diet and it really, in her case, wasn't in the little ones best interest so she had to put aside her own desires and offer a wider choice for her baby.  Hope you find something that suits you.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9172/#84307",
